    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bde807a21e7a801ca179df07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……现在随便什么都行。你知道她发生什么事了吗？\n我刚才也看到她了……感觉气氛不太寻常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde3f7fcfc7f44d16ebfb269fa5b70460183f571fd2ae1d199b877c96945600d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
