    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bfd2c9fe3e906c45e6ecc1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……嗯。虽说认识，但也算不上有什么特别深的交情……\n可是不知怎么的，就是很在意——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f16171384c045df839293552fa5fef5f950613c42c59faf797b55f134288f89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
