    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:897e81c6a6a6dbcd13721fe5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——不。抱歉，这是我自己的事。\n总之，如果发现了什么，请告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6854d6c6e2e87682a584839d9109b5f38d65969676b1ceb6453d05f8d5bc42b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22260c4d41f6acb2ccac6cf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天发生的各种事情，在我的脑海中盘旋不去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64c5246967815a217199fac6b954c53a7ff707adf66ee631a22455514a96ff00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af861e97b614d896ac7d096",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e88d223082bc2147cfd17e9247f4910aa0440abb0769c9be2601dedcb144838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b6fbff80117e556af08edf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我到底，在害怕些什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee0ecd80fe759e49490a7f837f835d9f4d220430aae930b7c8473527a893ea9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4434f24d8787ba30550a3ef7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在并跑中获胜的爱慕律动，为何流露出莫名的焦躁。\n新宇宙关于她口中的那句“LOST”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1f9d0fb94be667119fa8367b685f29571a25e9d55c471bfbba6668ffaa62a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef186f3255c6be1e79885987",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "完全……搞不懂。不管怎么想也……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13b193f45e85372f6c1a0e17591a5d3220e1ee161222dbbb9554c915ce463a97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c0026a3feb295628682ff81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以及不知为何很在意爱慕律动的气槽。\n这些事情，究竟意味着什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a8111a82d9ef69f3b38ce37bcb2e73b4692b177b67e59f304ac7a4c0e81d3ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a7d60aa6bbe81d137a6c335",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——或许是因为想着这些事情入睡的缘故吧。\n在半梦半醒之间，我做了一个奇怪的梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6779a21fda3bf07f934f5eae6df871404f3a664b2ecd2ed3f2a2c56b236d268f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff26cf2651d17237245d00d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "解说员",
      "source_fingerprint": "4008bec707b5da8466b977449da2d4b922f1f6bbab6cceca9982aaa914d2e188",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1118/storytimeline_041118003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb38510a9604174d7b42c8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是爱慕律动！\n此刻，她紧紧握住了双拳！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26413c728823e1a8149f7cc3291039580544949f8c38a16f70a7373d33c56185",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
