    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3735e540fa26fd1e17112581",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……真的是品味极其糟糕的“梦”——一遍又一遍……一遍又一遍……！\n无论是后冠，还是在那之后的……全部都被夺走……！被她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c07a64f354a2942ae4106d8ab8ead9d416a30962be22f76a13b1e2bb44dd79df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
