      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果是爱慕律动有惊无险地获得了胜利。\n然而本该是胜者的她，却带着一脸焦躁离去了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5ec838cfe9d0a85917dfe945e83d9027baaa469c00be3990c80dfa06fe1a804",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
