      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想如果在梦里看到的这种话说出来只会被当成怪人，\n便连忙敷衍了过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c8787ed82783cd747d4ef499b7453346dba57e8299c3022ce4c5f110bc2a3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
